warning: $REPO/examples/agents/langgraph.yaml:83:9: limits.wall 30m is a hard cap on the run's whole time: it ends the run at that mark even while the agent is working or the person is typing [wall-hard-cap]
  fix: for an interactive session set limits.stall_after (the person's typing counts as activity) and keep wall for a bound on the whole job
